#. ボクが護身用に持ち帰ってきた金箔の模擬刀だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is...the replica sword I brought back for\n"
"self-defense.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これが事件に使われた…って事か？
#. しかも、これって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does this mean...it was used in the attack somehow?\n"
"And plus...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>刀が抜かれてて、
#. 鞘だけになってるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The sword's been taken out, so it's just the sheath,\n"
"but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鞘に傷があるな…刃物かなんかで、
#. 斬り付けられたみたいな傷だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some scratches on the sheath. They must've\n"
"been made with something sharp...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でも、どうして…
#. 鞘なんかに斬り付けられた傷が？
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But...how'd the sheath get scratched up in the first\n"
"place?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この模擬刀が争いに使われたにしても、
#. 鞘に傷があるのは不自然だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even if someone used the sword during the struggle, it\n"
"doesn't make sense for the sheath to be damaged...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、模擬刀で襲い掛かるなら、
#. 普通は“刀を鞘から抜く”はずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, if you're gonna attack someone with a sword,\n"
"the first thing you'd do is unsheathe it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな重いだけの鞘はジャマでしかないし、
#. 争いの最中に、鞘が抜ける心配だってある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A heavy sheath like this would only get in the way. It\n"
"could just slide off in the middle of the fight.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なのに、どうして、
#. この鞘に刃物の傷が？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So...why are there scratches on the sheath?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>金箔の模擬刀（鞘）<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Replica Sword Sheath<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが護身用に持ち帰ってきた金箔の模擬刀だ。
#. しかも、これって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the replica sword I brought back for\n"
"self-defense. And plus...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>刀が抜かれてて、
#. 鞘だけになってるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The sword's been taken out, so it's just the sheath,\n"
"but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鞘に傷があるな…刃物かなんかで、
#. 斬り付けられたみたいな傷だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some scratches on the sheath. They must've\n"
"been made with something sharp...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でも、どうして…
#. 鞘なんかに斬り付けられた傷が？
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But...how'd the sheath get scratched up in the first\n"
"place?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この模擬刀が争いに使われたにしても、
#. 鞘に傷があるのは不自然だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even if someone used the sword during the struggle, it\n"
"doesn't make sense for the sheath to be damaged...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、模擬刀で襲い掛かるなら、
#. 普通は“刀を鞘から抜く”はずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, if you're gonna attack someone with a sword,\n"
"the first thing you'd do is unsheathe it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なのに、どうして、
#. この鞘に刃物の傷が？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So...why are there scratches on the sheath?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>床に鍵が落ちている…
#. ボクの名前のキーホルダーが付いた鍵だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a key on the ground... It has my name on it,\n"
"so this must be my room key.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確か、これって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I remember correctly...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …そうですね。お互いの鍵を交換しておきましょう。
msgctxt "0101 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Ah, that's right. We'll have to trade keys."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>部屋を交換した時、
#. ボク達は鍵も一緒に交換したんだった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When we switched rooms, we switched keys, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、この鍵は、
#. ずっとこの部屋で、舞園さんが持っていたはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So Sayaka would have had the key here in my room the\n"
"entire time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …待てよ。だとすると…
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But wait... If that's true, then..."
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、犯人はどうやって
#. この部屋に入ったんだ？
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...how did the killer get into the room in the first\n"
"place?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんが…鍵を掛け忘れた？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could Sayaka have forgotten to lock the door?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、それは考えられない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, that seems impossible...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんも…
#. 誰か来ても絶対にドアを開けちゃ駄目だよ。
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The same goes for you, Sayaka. No matter who it is,\n"
"don't open your door for anyone."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君だとわかっても絶対に開けませんよ。
#. でないと、部屋を交換した意味がありませんもんね。
msgctxt "0109 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid ""
"Even if I'm sure it's you, I absolutely won't open it.\n"
"Otherwise, what's the point of even switching?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言ってた彼女が鍵を掛け忘れたり、
#. 自分からドアを開けたとは考えられない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After saying that, there's no way she would have\n"
"forgotten to lock it, or opened it for any reason.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…落とした鍵を盗まれたとか…
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well...maybe she dropped the key somewhere, and\n"
"someone else grabbed it or something."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、それもないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, that's not possible, either...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>部屋を交換した後、
#. 舞園さんはそのまま部屋に残っていたんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka was in here when we switched rooms.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>怯えてた彼女が出歩くはずがない…
#. だとすると、鍵を盗まれる機会もなかったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And with how scared she was, she wouldn't have gone\n"
"walking around. So she couldn't have dropped it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だったら…犯人はどうやって…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So...how did the killer...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>部屋の交換について<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0116 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Switching Rooms<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この部屋の鍵は、
#. ずっとここにあったはずなのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0117 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>My room key must have been here in the room the entire\n"
"time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人はどうやって、
#. この部屋に入ったんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0118 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So how did the killer get inside?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しの中には工具セットが入っている。
#. 相変わらず、未開封のまま使用された形跡はない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0119 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The toolkit is still inside the drawer. I don't see\n"
"any evidence that it's been used at all.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …当り前か。
#. そもそも所有者であるボクが使ってないんだし…
msgctxt "0120 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Which makes sense, I guess. I mean, it's mine, and I\n"
"haven't had any reason to open it."
msgstr ""

#. …って言うか、この工具セットを使う
#. シチュエーションなんかあるのか…？
msgctxt "0121 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I can't even imagine a situation where I'd need a\n"
"toolkit like this..."
msgstr ""

#. …オメェもそう思ったか？
msgctxt "0122 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Yeah, seriously!"
msgstr ""

#. 大和田クン…
msgctxt "0123 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, Mondo..."
msgstr ""

#. オメェも使ってねーか…
#. そうだよな、工作や日曜大工って気分でもねーしな…
msgctxt "0124 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"We ain't exactly in the mood to be buildin' fuckin'\n"
"furniture, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 大和田クンも使ってないの？
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So you haven't used yours either, then?"
msgstr ""

#. オレだけじゃねー、他の連中もそうみたいだぜ。
msgctxt "0126 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Not just me. Nobody's busted theirs out yet, far as I\n"
"know."
msgstr ""

#. ちょうど昨日くらいに、
#. その話になったんだよ。
msgctxt "0127 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Actually, we were talkin' about it yesterday."
msgstr ""

#. 男連中は、誰も工具セットなんぞ使ってねーってよ。
#. まぁ、当たり前だけどな…
msgctxt "0128 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"None of the guys have opened their toolkits yet. Cuz\n"
"like, why the hell would we?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>工具セット<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0129 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Toolkit<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しの中には工具セットが入っている。
#. 未開封のまま使用された形跡はない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0130 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The toolkit is still inside the drawer. I don't see\n"
"any evidence that it's been used at all.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれ？　この粘着テープクリーナー…
#. いつの間にか、テープの残量がかなり減ってる。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? Looking at the lint roller...it looks like\n"
"there's way less than there was before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの部屋が汚れているのを見かねて、
#. 舞園さんが掃除でもしたのかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did Sayaka see how dirty my room was and decide to\n"
"clean up a little...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この粘着テープクリーナー…
#. いつの間にか、テープの残量がかなり減ってる。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? Looking at the lint roller...it looks like\n"
"there's way less than there was before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの部屋が汚れているのを見かねて、
#. 舞園さんが掃除でもしたのかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0134 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did Sayaka see how dirty my room was and decide to\n"
"clean up a little...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0135 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いまは校章が浮かんでいるだけか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、またいつモノクマが出てくるかと思うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't even wanna think about when he might show up\n"
"on that thing next...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はあ……
msgctxt "0138 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0139 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕はきっとこの監視カメラで、
#. 事の一部始終を見てたんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0140 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind must be using them to keep an eye on\n"
"everything that's happening here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>止めもしないで…見てたんだ…ッ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0141 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They don't do anything to stop what's happening...\n"
"They just keep on watching!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの最後のメッセージ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0142 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka's dying message...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かめないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0143 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to find out what it was.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>メモ帳がある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0144 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a notepad.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは、ここの備え付けってことかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0145 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess the school must have given one to each of\n"
"us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>傷付けられたような跡…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0146 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are gouges here, like someone damaged it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここで…何があったんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0147 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What the hell happened here...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>模擬刀が置いてあったスタンドだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0148 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the display stand the sword was on...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの最後のメッセージ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0149 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka's dying message...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かめないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0150 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to find out what it was.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
